  "signboards": [
    {
      "x": 3,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "A note is tucked in between the books.\n\"Adventure Rule No. 1: the menu is a traveller's best friend. Open it often.\""
    },
    {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "A second note, in the same hand.\n\"Adventure Rule No. 2: SAVE before anything daring, and after anything worth keeping.\""
    },
    {
      "x": 5,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "The shelf is crammed with books on Pokémon: where they live, what they eat, how they grow."
    },
    {
      "x": 6,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "Folders of field notes and research reports, every spine labelled in the professor's square hand."
    },
    {
      "x": 11,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "{player} looked at the PC.\nThe screen is a wall of graphs and technical terms. It might as well be written in Unown."
    },
    {
      "x": 20,
      "y": 2,
      "text": "The refrigerator is full of sweets, shelf upon shelf of them.\nSo that is what keeps a laboratory going..."
    }
  ],
